flowchart LR
    accTitle: Every cataloged Dryxio GTA repository mapped to a task family
    accDescr: Eighteen repository references and the separate texture project map to CLEO, native, reverse engineering, world authoring, multiplayer, graphics or navigation research. These are research references, not installed dependencies or verified integration claims.
    TASK["Choose task + exact GTA target\nConsult catalog and original upstreams\nRecord actual evaluation status"]:::hub
    CLEO["CLEO scripts"]:::gate
    NAT["Native ASI / engine limits"]:::gate
    REV["Reverse engineering / reconstruction"]:::gate
    WORLD["World / model / traffic authoring"]:::gate
    MP["Multiplayer / protocol / population"]:::gate
    VIS["Graphics / navigation comparison"]:::gate
    C1["cleo-ai\nLookup -> validate -> compile"]:::reference
    C2["library fork\nCLEO reference ecosystem"]:::reference
    N1["plugin-sdk-sa\nExact SA declarations / layouts"]:::reference
    N2["gta-reversed fork\nEngine behavior evidence"]:::reference
    N3["fastman92_limit_adjuster fork\nSupported targets and engine limits"]:::reference
    R1["ghidra-bridge\nBounded xrefs / types / CFG / P-code"]:::reference
    R2["reagent\nCandidate reconstruction + validation reports"]:::reference
    W1["ariane\nIII / VC / SA map editing"]:::reference
    W2["gta-scout\nAsset discovery / Blender handoff"]:::reference
    W3["gta-flow\nTraffic graph / deterministic roundtrip"]:::reference
    W4["GTA SA Textures IRL\nProfile-linked texture research\nSeparate from the 18-repo inventory"]:::reference
    M1["samp-source\nR5 byte-matching research"]:::reference
    M2["samp-r5-rebuild\nR5 functional rebuild research"]:::reference
    M3["mtasa-neon\nMTA-derived population systems"]:::reference
    M4["mtasa-blue fork\nOriginal engine/platform context"]:::reference
    M5["wiki.mtasa-neon.com\nNeon documentation"]:::reference
    V1["skygfx fork\nGraphics / mod-stack comparison"]:::reference
    V2["GTA-GPS-Redux fork\nNavigation behavior and dependencies"]:::reference
    V3["Radar-in-style-GTA-SA-\nThe-Definitive-Edition fork\nRadar presentation reference"]:::reference
    RESULT["Return findings to public workshop\nTarget / revision / method / actual checks\nLimits / fork credits / reuse terms"]:::evidence
    TASK --> CLEO & NAT & REV & WORLD & MP & VIS
    CLEO --> C1 & C2
    NAT --> N1 & N2 & N3
    REV --> R1 & R2
    WORLD --> W1 & W2 & W3 & W4
    MP --> M1 & M2 & M3 & M4 & M5
